---
source: crates/navree-orm/tests/sql/main.rs
expression: "rows(table(\"deals as d\").select([\"d.title as name\", \"d.*\"]))"
---
PostgreSQL: SELECT "d"."title" AS "name", "d".* FROM "deals" AS "d"
MySQL: SELECT `d`.`title` AS `name`, `d`.* FROM `deals` AS `d`
SQLite: SELECT "d"."title" AS "name", "d".* FROM "deals" AS "d"
